				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Saul </wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1431062</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's implied it wouldn't have power over anything anymore, like all the other AI's the foundation contains. It's taken out of the nuclear launch system and into safe storage. And the foundation never actually did place any power in the &quot;hands&quot; of an AI, it developed sentience spontaneously and they immediately tried to wrestle back control of their nukes.</p> 
				 	]]>
