					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-391781#post-2720005</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-391781/sparks-of-creativity#post-2720005</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 04 Jan 2017 02:03:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Blackfluidexv</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1811018</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I have personally thought and forgot of this a half dozen times, and I am so utterly pissed that you did it so well.<br /> The thoughts are put together in the most amazing fashion. The whole &quot;OH THIS IS THING, THING EXISTS.&quot; portion of the story was beautifully done in and of itself, but the fact that you put it realizing how there were degrees, defining what something it had probably felt a minute ago was, and the sheer &quot;do this see response, elicit response again and string it together to see what happens.&quot; just makes it feel like a genuine being existing and overflowing with wonder.</p> <p>Honestly the only way I believe it could be better would be if it was a downloadable thought.</p> <p>-1 for stealing a memory</p> <p>+2 for doing it better than I could have.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
