					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Moscow had the nicest ring to it - and if I said &quot;LA&quot; or &quot;Detroit&quot; they'd think &quot;shit, I had an aunt/cousin there&quot; and it'd be a downer. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">But nobody here gives a fuck about Russia</span>, so my nuclear AI can incinerate millions to comic effect!</p> <p>EDIT: I swear that sounded better in my head. Somehow. I'm an idiot and I apologise.</p> 
				 	]]>
